      "statement": "`dispatch_agent_run` is the shared agent/reviewer dispatch boundary: it accepts prebuilt structured `RunInput` or constructs input from content and identity context, then delegates to `create_durable_run` with a caller-selectable multitask strategy that defaults to `\"interrupt\"`.",
